{
 "about": [
  "appdata/addons.ltx as the engine reads it: ParseSimpleIni (merge_repeated = false) + ReadLauncherList (xray-16/src/xrGame/addon_host.cpp); launcher addon_slots.rs check_addons_ltx (syntax), addons_ltx.rs has_no_section, read_list. The input: 'text' (UTF-8) or 'hex' (raw bytes).",
  "readable: ok; syntax - a syntax error of the strict reader; no_section - no section at all (0 bytes, blanks, comments, a BOM: a write cut short). Both: the engine ignores the file and loads no plugin.",
  "is_list: the file has [addons] or an [addon.<...>] section (any name after the prefix). Without it the addon folders are scanned as without the file.",
  "entries: the [addon.<id>] sections with a valid id (a-z 0-9 _, up to 64), in the order of the file, a repeated one ignored. path - the first non-empty value of path (comment, blanks, one pair of quotes cut; '' - not given); path_utf8 false - the value is not valid UTF-8 (the engine fails the addon, A5), no path then. enabled - the first non-empty value of enabled is true / on / yes (any case) or 1; no value - true."
 ],
 "cases": [
  {
   "name": "launcher_list",
   "text": "[addons]\nformat = 1\n\n[addon.my_addon]\nenabled = true\ntrust = index\ncatalog = global-war-addons\n\n[addon.gw_npc]\npath = addons\\gw_npc\nenabled = false\ntrust = first_party\nplugin_sha256 = abababababababababababababababababababababababababababababababab\n",
   "expect": {
    "readable": "ok",
    "is_list": true,
    "entries": [
     {
      "id": "my_addon",
      "path": "",
      "path_utf8": true,
      "enabled": true
     },
     {
      "id": "gw_npc",
      "path": "addons\\gw_npc",
      "path_utf8": true,
      "enabled": false
     }
    ]
   }
  },
